OL,3,GNEWSAMemory of son drives mother's
OL,4,Afundraising mission
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother who lost her son to a brain
OL,7,Ftumour says fundraising has given her a
OL,8,Fpurpose and helps ensure he is never
OL,9,Fforgotten.
OL,11,FHayley Bull from St Sampson, Guernsey,
OL,12,Fhas raised more than #22,000 for the
OL,13,FBrain Tumour Charity in memory of her
OL,14,Fson James Robilliard, who died in 2024
OL,15,Faged 33 after being diagnosed with an
OL,16,Faggressive brain tumour.
OL,18,FShe has also established the James
OL,19,FRobilliard Fund and continues to
OL,20,Forganise awareness campaigns and
OL,21,Ffundraising events.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
