OL,3,GNEWSAMemory of son drives mother's
OL,4,Afundraising mission
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlthough fundraising has become a major
OL,7,Fpart of her life, Bull said grief
OL,8,Fremained a daily reality and she
OL,9,Fregularly visited a memorial bench
OL,10,Foverlooking one of her son's favourite
OL,11,Ffishing spots.
